                          Table "public.event_outbox"
       Column       |           Type           | Collation | Nullable | Default 
--------------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+---------
 id                 | text                     |           | not null | 
 channel            | text                     |           | not null | 
 user_id            | text                     |           | not null | 
 payload            | jsonb                    |           | not null | 
 actor_kind         | text                     |           | not null | 
 actor_id           | text                     |           | not null | 
 created_at         | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | now()
 origin_instance_id | text                     |           | not null | 
 consumer           | text                     |           |          | 
 fact               | jsonb                    |           |          | 
 processed_at       | timestamp with time zone |           |          | 
 deliver_to_origin  | boolean                  |           | not null | false
Indexes:
    "event_outbox_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "idx_event_outbox_actor" btree (actor_kind, actor_id)
    "idx_event_outbox_created_at" btree (created_at)
    "idx_event_outbox_pending" btree (consumer, created_at, id) WHERE consumer IS NOT NULL AND processed_at IS NULL
Check constraints:
    "event_outbox_actor_id_check" CHECK (length(actor_id) > 0)
    "event_outbox_actor_id_nonempty" CHECK (length(actor_id) > 0)
    "event_outbox_actor_kind_check" CHECK (actor_kind = ANY (ARRAY['user'::text, 'job'::text, 'mcp'::text]))
    "event_outbox_fact_pair" CHECK (consumer IS NULL AND fact IS NULL AND processed_at IS NULL OR consumer IS NOT NULL AND length(consumer) > 0 AND fact IS NOT NULL)

